audrey: AudreyTouch's feedback synth (Infrasonic Audio / Synthux Academy, MIT)
as a Nebulae program. Only the lines between nebconfigbegin and nebconfigend are
read; this text is not.

Start with density low: Audrey can get loud suddenly.

Knobs and buttons (change the osc: lines to move them, no compile needed):
  density  feedback gain, the main control (S30): wakes the loop
  blend    reverb dry/wet (S32)          size     reverb size (S33)
  window   low pass in the loop (S34)    overlap  high pass in the loop (S35)
  start    body (S37; right = shortest delay, as the top of the fader)
  reset    gate: held = note on, as touching a pad (button or gate input)
  freeze   drone: the loop keeps ringing without a gate
  source   on: the input is audrey's own left output (feedback); off: the input jack

Encoder pages (click = next page, turn = value; the LEDs show the value as
pitch does, the LED that stays dark shows the page colour, dim; saved):
  pitch    1 note (pitch CV here: 1V/oct)   2 envelope shape (red)
  speed    1 input level   2 body LFO (red): off, fast 1-8 Hz, slow 0.01-0.5 Hz
           (with the LFO on, start sets its rate and spread)

Example how pageEncoder has for settings in nebsettings:
Field by field, page:speed:input,/audrey/input,0,1,lin,0.3,0.005 means:

┌────────────────┬─────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│      Part      │  Value  │                                                                  Meaning                                                                  │
├────────────────┼─────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ page:          │         │ This line is an encoder page.                                                                                                             │
├────────────────┼─────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ speed          │         │ Which encoder: speed or pitch.                                                                                                            │
├────────────────┼─────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ input          │         │ The page's name. Used in .pages (saved values), in cv:speed,input, and as NebPage.kr(\input) in a .scd.                                   │
├────────────────┼─────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ /audrey/input  │ path    │ The OSC address the value is sent to. The program (audrey/source/main.cc) listens for exactly this path.                                  │
├────────────────┼─────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ 0              │ min     │ What is sent when the page is at its lowest.                                                                                              │
├────────────────┼─────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ 1              │ max     │ What is sent when the page is at its highest.                                                                                             │
├────────────────┼─────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ lin            │ curve   │ How min to max is spread over the turns: lin evenly; exp exponentially, good for frequencies and times (min and max must be > 0); int     │
│                │         │ evenly, rounded to whole numbers (e.g. lfo 0, 1, 2).                                                                                      │
├────────────────┼─────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ 0.3            │ default │ Where the page starts the first time, before anything is saved, as a fraction of the range from 0 to 1. Here 0.3, so 0.3 is sent.         │
│                │         │ After that the saved value in audrey.pages is used.                                                                                       │
├────────────────┼─────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ 0.005          │ step    │ Optional. How much of the range one encoder click moves: 0.005 means 200 clicks from min to max (without it: 0.01, 100 clicks).           │
└────────────────┴─────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

Where the pitch and speed CV go: hold file + reset, click pitch or speed to
choose a page (its LEDs glow in that page's colour, dim white = nowhere),
release both. Saved for this program.

The OSC paths audrey knows are listed in source/main.cc.

nebconfigbegin
run,audrey
oscport,3021
kernel,normal
blocksize,128
reset,momentary,rising
freeze,latching,rising
osc:density,/audrey/feedback,0,1
osc:blend,/audrey/reverb_mix,0,1
osc:size,/audrey/reverb_size,0,1
osc:window,/audrey/lpf,0,1
osc:overlap,/audrey/hpf,0,1
osc:start,/audrey/body,0,1
osc:reset,/audrey/gate,0,1
osc:freeze,/audrey/drone,0,1
osc:source,/audrey/source,0,1
page:pitch:note,/audrey/note,16,76,lin,0.4
page:pitch:shape,/audrey/shape,0,1,lin,0
page:speed:input,/audrey/input,0,1,lin,0.3
page:speed:lfo,/audrey/lfo,0,2,int,0
cv:pitch,note
cv:speed,none
nebconfigend
